  "dry_snp_activity": "On the Post-Panamax sector, the Scrubber fitted “Claas Oldendorff” - 96K/2013 Imabari was sold for USD 27 mills to Asian buyers, while the 5-year old Kamsarmax “BW Kobe” - 82K/2019 Tsuneishi Cebu was sold for USD 37 mills to Korean buyers. A couple of enbloc sales were seen in the Handy space. Clients of Precious Shipping acquired 4x 39K Handysizes enbloc, the “Western Durban” - 39K/2015 JNS, the “Western Lima” - 39K/2015 JNS, the “Western Mi- ami” - 39K/2015 JNS and the “Western Paris”- 39K/2015 JNS for shade below USD 78 mills. Further- more, on the same sector, the “Voge Mia” - 37K/2011 HMD and the “Voge Emma” - 37K/2011 HMD found new owners for low USD 15 mills each.",
